ut the performance tonight. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All the effort you've put in these past few days will bear fruit in this very performance. You wonder how it will go..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sakura","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-270","spriteScale":"1.27"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sakura Minamoto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, do you need a break?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm okay."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A pair of gentle hands start massaging your shoulders. Your empty coffee mug has also been refilled."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yugiri","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"120,-150","spriteScale":"1.85"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Drink_Tea","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Yugiri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't get too engrossed in your work, Commander. It's a sunny day, so you should go out and get some sun."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-170","spriteScale":"1.21"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, work can wait!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'll be right there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Saki","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-190","spriteScale":"1.4"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Saki Nikaido","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop dawdling! The sun will be gone before you know it!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Camera_Focus","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're just about to answer another call when Saki pu